1
00:00:09,440 --> 00:00:11,760
You've been avoiding me, Song Yanfei.

2
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:15,300
What are you avoiding?

3
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:19,080
What am I avoiding?

4
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:21,610
I'm not avoiding anything.

5
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:24,360
As for you,

6
00:00:24,640 --> 00:00:25,900
after all these years,

7
00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:28,000
you still can't shake off
your detective habit

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:29,520
of suspecting people.

9
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:34,080
Some things

10
00:00:35,560 --> 00:00:36,800
never change.

11
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:41,010
Just like when we were kids,

12
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:42,980
we both loved coming here.

13
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:47,640
Song Yanfei, look. Is it pretty?

14
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:48,960
It's so pretty.

15
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:50,320
I love it.

16
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:52,160
And this water bottle.

17
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:54,800
You can use it
when you get tired from dancing.

18
00:00:58,120 --> 00:00:59,760
I still have that water bottle

19
00:00:59,760 --> 00:01:00,920
you gave me.

20
00:01:01,480 --> 00:01:03,680
You saw it at the rehearsal room, right?

21
00:01:05,239 --> 00:01:05,840
By the way,

22
00:01:06,520 --> 00:01:08,320
I still have something of yours.

23
00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:10,039
I'll bring it to you some other day.

24
00:01:10,039 --> 00:01:11,880
Giving my own things to me

25
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:15,280
is called returning them
to their rightful owner.

26
00:01:15,320 --> 00:01:17,850
Alright, returning it
to its rightful owner.

27
00:01:19,160 --> 00:01:20,200
Before returning it,

28
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:22,000
can I trade this little item

29
00:01:22,400 --> 00:01:23,680
for a drink?

30
00:01:27,880 --> 00:01:28,440
Let's go.

31
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:33,640
My mom was just talking
about you a few days ago.

32
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:34,360
She

33
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:35,720
asked when you were coming back

34
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:36,520
and wanted to cook

35
00:01:36,520 --> 00:01:37,320
you a meal.

36
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:39,400
I really haven't seen her in a long time.

37
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:40,400
Let's arrange it.

38
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:41,729
How about Saturday?

39
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:42,800
After rehearsal.

40
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:45,080
Is it okay if I bring Yayan?

41
00:01:45,759 --> 00:01:46,520
Of course.

42
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:47,560
There will be a few others there too.

43
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:48,220
That works.

44
00:02:04,880 --> 00:02:06,080
I've talked to my mom.

45
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:09,850
Come over this weekend.

46
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:16,200
Song Yanfei, you'd better be clean.

47
00:02:16,520 --> 00:02:19,050
You'd better be completely
clean all the way.

48
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,450
You should know,

49
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:23,680
whether as a criminal investigator
or a traffic cop,

50
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:25,760
I am a police officer first.

51
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:28,800
I have to be worthy of my badge.

52
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:37,680
Let's eat, let's eat.

53
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:39,079
Thanks, Mom.

54
00:02:39,079 --> 00:02:40,280
Thanks for your help, Jiang.

55
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,160
It's nothing.

56
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:43,360
Ma'am,

57
00:02:43,360 --> 00:02:45,079
I'm just so happy to eat your cooking.

58
00:02:45,079 --> 00:02:46,480
I already sneaked a bite.

59
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:49,280
You're such a sweet talker.

60
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:50,680
He's so annoying.

61
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:52,560
But seriously,

62
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:54,760
I haven't seen you two

63
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:55,760
in years.

64
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:57,450
I really missed you.

65
00:02:57,640 --> 00:02:58,480
Tell me about it.

66
00:02:58,480 --> 00:03:00,940
I wouldn't even recognize you
on the street.

67
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,520
And this is...?

68
00:03:03,320 --> 00:03:04,840
I haven't had the chance to introduce her.

69
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:07,000
This is my girlfriend, Gao Yayan.

70
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,280
Hello.

71
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,520
Just call me Yayan.

72
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:10,850
Look at that.

73
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:12,440
Li Xingchen,

74
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:16,480
can't you give me some peace of mind?

75
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:18,360
Look how pretty his girlfriend is.

76
00:03:18,360 --> 00:03:19,240
Right?

77
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:22,880
Zheng's wife

78
00:03:22,880 --> 00:03:25,079
introduced a girl to you before, right?

79
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:26,480
Her last name was also Gao.

80
00:03:26,480 --> 00:03:27,400
Named... named... named...

81
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,680
That was me.

82
00:03:29,079 --> 00:03:30,760
Captain Li and I
went on a blind date before.

83
00:03:30,760 --> 00:03:31,760
It's just that...

84
00:03:32,480 --> 00:03:33,280
Mom,

85
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:34,800
Jiang is hungry.

86
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,730
My name is Jiang.

87
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:37,720
Let's get back to our meal.

88
00:03:37,720 --> 00:03:38,800
Let's eat.

89
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:39,480
Come on.

90
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:42,280
Let me make the first toast today.

91
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:43,160
Cheers.

92
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:44,320
You are all

93
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:46,040
in the prime of your lives right now.

94
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:48,079
Wishing you a bright future.

95
00:03:48,079 --> 00:03:48,960
May your days ahead

96
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,120
be better

97
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,480
and smoother.

98
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:53,280
Ma'am.

99
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:55,920
Let's all thank our hosts.

100
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:58,840
Thank you.

101
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,080
What's wrong?

102
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:10,680
Can't hold on anymore?

103
00:04:10,680 --> 00:04:11,480
Wanna give up?

104
00:04:12,040 --> 00:04:12,640
It's fine.

105
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:14,210
Give up if you can't hold on.

106
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,520
There are so many good girls out there,

107
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,680
not just Shen Xi.

108
00:04:18,640 --> 00:04:19,959
I'm a devoted guy.

109
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:20,920
Stubborn

110
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:22,120
and obsessed.

111
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:23,880
I just like Shen Xi.

112
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:24,880
What should I do?

113
00:04:24,880 --> 00:04:27,540
It's been so long
and there's no progress at all.

114
00:04:27,880 --> 00:04:28,540
Do you think

115
00:04:29,200 --> 00:04:30,440
I should be brave

116
00:04:30,440 --> 00:04:31,440
and say hi to her?

117
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:33,460
She already knows I exist anyway.

118
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:38,880
Who told you she knows you exist?

119
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:43,080
Didn't you say she knows I exist

120
00:04:43,080 --> 00:04:44,680
and that someone is following her?

121
00:04:44,680 --> 00:04:46,880
But she doesn't know that person is you.

122
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:49,320
I thought

123
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,240
you had already dropped hints

124
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:52,770
and put in a good word for me.

125
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:55,560
Drink three glasses as a penalty.

126
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:57,020
Drink up and I'll tell you.

127
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:16,410
That's sincere.

128
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,480
My sister

129
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:21,880
has actually been set up
on many blind dates by our family.

130
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:23,320
Civil servants,

131
00:05:23,320 --> 00:05:24,160
rich kids,

132
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:25,000
scholars...

133
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:26,770
she didn't like any of them.

134
00:05:27,360 --> 00:05:28,960
If her standards are so high,

135
00:05:29,080 --> 00:05:30,200
then I have even less hope.

136
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:31,660
Don't rush, let me finish.

137
00:05:31,840 --> 00:05:33,120
My sister is

138
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:34,720
silly and innocent.

139
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:35,720
She believes

140
00:05:36,240 --> 00:05:37,800
in destiny.

141
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,560
I get it.

142
00:05:41,760 --> 00:05:42,280
So

143
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:44,760
I need to create a chance encounter.

144
00:05:46,320 --> 00:05:48,520
Let me tell you something interesting.

145
00:05:48,520 --> 00:05:50,360
Once my sister was crossing the street,

146
00:05:50,360 --> 00:05:52,159
and because there were many cars
and it was dangerous,

147
00:05:52,159 --> 00:05:54,360
a traffic cop escorted her
across the crosswalk.

148
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:55,080
Guess what?

149
00:05:56,280 --> 00:05:58,159
My sister fell for him.

150
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:00,120
And then?

151
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:01,880
What then? There was no then.

152
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:02,560
She just liked him,

153
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,820
they didn't even talk.

154
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:05,080
If you were a cop

155
00:06:05,640 --> 00:06:06,520
and bumped into her once,

156
00:06:06,520 --> 00:06:08,250
maybe my sister would like you.

157
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:09,760
A cop?

158
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,280
Shrimp.

159
00:06:13,440 --> 00:06:14,680
Smells so good.

160
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:16,120
Eat more, eat more.

161
00:06:17,320 --> 00:06:17,920
Xingchen,

162
00:06:18,280 --> 00:06:19,540
what are your hobbies?

163
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,280
These two

164
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:22,280
are quite a match.

165
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:23,060
What are

166
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:25,080
those two whispering about?

167
00:06:25,080 --> 00:06:26,160
Can't we whisper?

168
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:28,520
Saying you've become a big director.

169
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:29,440
Saying you

170
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:31,170
can be a director, but he can't.

171
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,480
I remember

172
00:06:32,760 --> 00:06:34,920
I had a love-hate relationship
with him when I was a kid.

173
00:06:34,920 --> 00:06:35,520
I loved that

174
00:06:35,520 --> 00:06:36,760
we shared hobbies

175
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:37,960
and had a lot to talk about.

176
00:06:37,960 --> 00:06:38,620
I hated that

177
00:06:38,880 --> 00:06:40,440
every time there was a school performance,

178
00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:41,640
he'd mess it up

179
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:42,480
and steal my thunder.

180
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:44,680
Otherwise, I would have been
the leader, you know?

181
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:46,610
You guys had school performances?

182
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:48,840
It's a pity
there were no videos back then.

183
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:51,300
I've never seen
what you looked like as a kid.

184
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:52,200
Right, right, right.

185
00:06:52,200 --> 00:06:53,120
Wait a minute, guys.

186
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:54,680
I have a surprise for you later.

187
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,440
What is it?

188
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:57,200
No way.

189
00:06:57,200 --> 00:06:57,640
What's wrong?

190
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:59,320
Ignore her. Your aunt is...

191
00:07:01,560 --> 00:07:02,200
Let's drink.

192
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:03,240
Come on, welcome.

193
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:03,920
Thank you, sir.

194
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:05,400
Thank you. Thank you, sir.

195
00:07:05,400 --> 00:07:06,280
Thank you guys.

196
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,210
Tastes good.

197
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,560
Come on, eat up.

198
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:13,120
Come on.

199
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:13,720
Here it is.

200
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:14,480
What is it, Auntie?

201
00:07:14,480 --> 00:07:15,280
Come open it and see.

202
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:15,640
What?

203
00:07:16,840 --> 00:07:17,760
Cassette tapes.

204
00:07:17,760 --> 00:07:18,760
Yes, look for it.

205
00:07:18,760 --> 00:07:19,760
Which one?

206
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:21,360
Not the one with floral packaging.

207
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:22,480
It's kraft paper.

208
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:23,400
With words on it.

209
00:07:23,400 --> 00:07:23,960
This one?

210
00:07:24,080 --> 00:07:24,760
Yes, yes, yes.

211
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:27,720
Fifth-grade performance. Yes, yes, yes.

212
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:29,160
Hurry, put it in the tape player.

213
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:30,200
Mom, you're amazing.

214
00:07:30,200 --> 00:07:31,600
You really are an archivist.

215
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:33,280
You kept it for so many years.

216
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:33,880
Of course.

217
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:35,880
You can rest assured
when things are with me.

218
00:07:35,880 --> 00:07:36,880
Okay, okay, okay.

219
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:44,000
Hello, everyone. I'm Song Yanfei
from Class 3, Grade 5.

220
00:07:45,320 --> 00:07:46,280
Hello, everyone.

221
00:07:46,280 --> 00:07:48,600
I'm Li Xingchen from Class 3, Grade 5.

222
00:07:51,080 --> 00:07:53,159
Spring has arrived once again,

223
00:07:53,159 --> 00:07:55,080
bringing beautiful scenery.

224
00:07:55,080 --> 00:07:58,440
When butterflies dance joyfully
in the wind,

225
00:07:58,520 --> 00:08:02,320
and green leaves sprout from the earth,

226
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:03,120
today,

227
00:08:03,120 --> 00:08:05,440
all the students
of Checheng No. 2 Primary School

228
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:06,680
gather here

229
00:08:06,880 --> 00:08:08,600
to welcome our

230
00:08:08,600 --> 00:08:10,520
autumn art performance.

231
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:11,480
First,

232
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:13,400
please enjoy the opening song,

233
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:21,640
"Where is Spring".

234
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:25,560
♪ Spring is in the eyes of the children ♪

235
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:27,760
♪ There are red flowers

236
00:08:27,760 --> 00:08:29,720
and green grass here ♪

237
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:33,280
♪ And the little yellow orioles
that can sing ♪

238
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:52,600
Let's raise a glass

239
00:08:52,880 --> 00:08:53,960
to Auntie,

240
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,600
for hosting

241
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:57,360
such a delicious family dinner,

242
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,520
and letting us hear

243
00:08:58,520 --> 00:09:01,250
about their embarrassing
fifth-grade stories.

244
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:02,480
Come on.

245
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:03,540
Thank you, Auntie.

246
00:09:03,960 --> 00:09:04,800
Thank you.

247
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:10,400
See?

248
00:09:10,840 --> 00:09:12,560
Even without video,

249
00:09:12,560 --> 00:09:13,760
I've recorded the past

250
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:15,360
for you, haven't I?

251
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:16,560
So,

252
00:09:16,560 --> 00:09:18,000
even without images,

253
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:20,360
sound can record everything

254
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:22,320
that happened in the past.

255
00:09:22,720 --> 00:09:24,360
And even without sound,

256
00:09:24,360 --> 00:09:25,600
our memories

257
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:27,240
can record all

258
00:09:27,240 --> 00:09:30,120
the beautiful things we want to remember.

259
00:09:32,040 --> 00:09:34,720
You put that beautifully, ma'am.

260
00:09:34,760 --> 00:09:35,760
No wonder our...

261
00:09:35,760 --> 00:09:36,400
our

262
00:09:36,400 --> 00:09:37,860
Captain Li writes poetry.

263
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:38,640
Really,

264
00:09:38,760 --> 00:09:40,240
you're absolutely our

265
00:09:40,520 --> 00:09:41,480
idol.

266
00:09:41,800 --> 00:09:44,130
You're such a sweet talker.
Eat up, eat up.

267
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:45,660
Captain Li,

268
00:09:46,040 --> 00:09:46,840
what's wrong?

269
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:49,000
Are you stuck in the fifth grade?

270
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:50,440
Sound.

271
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:54,840
Not just video.

272
00:09:55,920 --> 00:09:57,050
There's also sound.

273
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:02,360
Let's eat.

274
00:10:02,640 --> 00:10:03,240
Let's eat.

275
00:10:11,160 --> 00:10:13,040
Captain Li's inspiration last night

276
00:10:13,040 --> 00:10:14,480
was a stroke of genius.

277
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:17,400
We were only focusing
on the visuals before.

278
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,760
The footage from these dozen trail cameras

279
00:10:18,760 --> 00:10:20,160
is really massive.

280
00:10:20,760 --> 00:10:21,880
We just fast-forwarded

281
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:24,120
and played frame by frame
when we saw useful footage.

282
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,440
We only focused on Bai Xiaosi.

283
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:27,170
We went in the wrong direction.

284
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,280
Bai Xiaosi came to dump the hemp rope

285
00:10:29,280 --> 00:10:30,400
the night before.

286
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:32,200
Now we're mainly checking the next day.

287
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,920
Did it record

288
00:10:33,920 --> 00:10:35,720
Xiao Ze and Shen Xi's conversation?

289
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:37,120
If it did,

290
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:38,400
we can use it

291
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:40,560
to reconstruct what really happened.

292
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:43,160
It should have.

293
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:45,560
I asked the guys at the station
first thing this morning.

294
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:47,240
They said an important part of

295
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:48,280
shooting a bird documentary

296
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:49,760
is recording bird calls.

297
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:52,280
So the audio recording is always on.

298
00:10:52,680 --> 00:10:53,520
But since

299
00:10:54,640 --> 00:10:56,760
the camera was up in a tree,

300
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:59,020
the dialogue might not be that clear.

301
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:01,540
Can it be restored?

302
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:02,880
It should be.

303
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:05,460
Just wait a bit. It's almost done.

304
00:11:58,280 --> 00:11:58,960
Shen Xi,

305
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:00,920
you're finally here.

306
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:02,840
Xiao Ze,

307
00:12:03,600 --> 00:12:05,000
what exactly do you want?

308
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:05,800
I

309
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:08,520
just like you.

310
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:10,320
I want to be with you.

311
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:13,680
You like me?

312
00:12:15,800 --> 00:12:18,480
You've been stalking me
from the very beginning.

313
00:12:18,480 --> 00:12:21,080
You even set up a telescope
at home to peep on me.

314
00:12:21,280 --> 00:12:22,480
You're a pervert.

315
00:12:22,560 --> 00:12:23,760
A peeping Tom.

316
00:12:24,120 --> 00:12:25,400
But I helped you.

317
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:27,400
Helped me?

318
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:32,820
You did help me.

319
00:12:34,040 --> 00:12:36,200
I almost forgot
if you hadn't mentioned it.

320
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:36,880
Shen Xi,

321
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:38,640
I'm not bringing this up

322
00:12:38,640 --> 00:12:39,800
to threaten you.

323
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:42,120
Song Yanfei told me everything.

324
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:43,160
Gao Yuhai

325
00:12:43,880 --> 00:12:45,540
deserved to be hit and killed.

326
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:48,160
I just want to tell you

327
00:12:48,960 --> 00:12:50,360
that I really like you.

328
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:51,680
Just accept me

329
00:12:51,680 --> 00:12:53,280
and let me be your boyfriend.

330
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,850
I already have a boyfriend.

331
00:12:56,520 --> 00:12:57,680
Song Yanfei, right?

332
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:02,640
I may be naive

333
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:04,160
and cowardly,

334
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:05,900
but I'm not stupid.

335
00:13:06,840 --> 00:13:08,080
I asked around.

336
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:11,040
He's not your brother at all.

337
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:12,920
Among all your relatives,

338
00:13:12,920 --> 00:13:15,380
you only have three sisters
and one brother.

339
00:13:16,880 --> 00:13:17,320
Also,

340
00:13:18,280 --> 00:13:20,940
why didn't you go
to the performance yesterday?

341
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:23,760
Do you think I really don't know?

342
00:13:26,720 --> 00:13:27,650
What do you know?

343
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:30,380
You are one of the performers.

344
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:31,800
Shen Xi,

345
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:33,920
You're right.

346
00:13:34,360 --> 00:13:36,690
I watch you dance
on the balcony every day.

347
00:13:37,800 --> 00:13:39,280
From the angle of your movements

348
00:13:39,280 --> 00:13:40,680
and your physical features,

349
00:13:40,680 --> 00:13:41,920
I can tell at a glance.

350
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:43,920
Even though you wear a mask,

351
00:13:44,480 --> 00:13:45,680
I can still recognize

352
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:46,960
that it's you.

353
00:13:51,080 --> 00:13:52,200
So after the show,

354
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:54,640
I went to wait backstage.

355
00:13:55,680 --> 00:13:57,600
Dancing with this on is so annoying.

356
00:13:57,600 --> 00:13:59,400
I almost lost my balance.

357
00:13:59,520 --> 00:14:01,360
Yeah, I don't know what
Director Song was thinking,

358
00:14:01,360 --> 00:14:02,920
coming up with this last minute.

359
00:14:02,920 --> 00:14:04,000
Didn't you notice?

360
00:14:04,000 --> 00:14:06,640
The formation today was
different from usual.

361
00:14:06,880 --> 00:14:08,880
Yeah, it really was.

362
00:14:09,520 --> 00:14:11,000
It seemed like there was an extra person.

363
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:11,600
During rehearsal,

364
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:12,600
that person wasn't there.

365
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:13,680
That extra person,

366
00:14:13,680 --> 00:14:14,560
I heard,

367
00:14:14,560 --> 00:14:16,560
is Director Song's ex-girlfriend.

368
00:14:18,600 --> 00:14:20,800
Hello, Director Song.

369
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:22,240
Remember to eat later.

370
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:23,280
Will do.

371
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:29,320
Is everything going well?

372
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:31,380
No one saw you on your way here, right?

373
00:14:33,480 --> 00:14:34,680
Except for Bai Sha,

374
00:14:35,080 --> 00:14:36,410
no one else should have.

375
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:37,800
Yanfei,

376
00:14:38,040 --> 00:14:39,160
this is too risky.

377
00:14:39,160 --> 00:14:39,960
It's really not necessary.

378
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:40,880
It is.

379
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:44,200
You are the female lead
of this dance drama.

380
00:14:44,800 --> 00:14:46,000
It's so unfair to you,

381
00:14:46,960 --> 00:14:48,960
having to dance in this stupid mask.

382
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:57,200
Yanfei,

383
00:14:58,880 --> 00:15:00,810
let's stop contacting each other.

384
00:15:03,760 --> 00:15:04,960
Just forget about me.

385
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:10,120
We're on the last step.

386
00:15:11,120 --> 00:15:12,280
We're almost there.

387
00:15:12,760 --> 00:15:14,360
Just hold on a little longer, okay?

388
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:15,080
No,

389
00:15:15,200 --> 00:15:16,440
this is too crazy.

390
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:17,600
We'll get caught.

391
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:21,800
Besides, you're with Gao Yayan now.

392
00:15:22,680 --> 00:15:24,080
She's a good girl.

393
00:15:34,920 --> 00:15:36,650
I don't want to do this anymore.

394
00:15:37,480 --> 00:15:38,360
Let it go.

395
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:44,160
Don't worry.

396
00:15:45,040 --> 00:15:46,160
Even if I die,

397
00:15:46,920 --> 00:15:48,850
I won't let anything happen to you.

398
00:15:49,600 --> 00:15:50,930
Hold on a little longer.

399
00:15:51,280 --> 00:15:51,920
Trust me.

400
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:56,480
Yanfei,

401
00:15:57,880 --> 00:15:59,760
if this ever gets exposed,

402
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:02,960
remember it was all my idea.

403
00:16:03,400 --> 00:16:04,360
It has nothing to do with you.

404
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:06,480
It won't.

405
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:08,320
Trust me.

406
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:10,490
I'll always be with you.

407
00:16:14,680 --> 00:16:15,540
You go that way.

408
00:16:16,480 --> 00:16:17,610
I'll find you later.

409
00:16:18,840 --> 00:16:19,360
Go.

410
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:53,520
Shen Xi,

411
00:16:54,160 --> 00:16:56,480
I don't care what plans
you have with Song Yanfei,

412
00:16:56,480 --> 00:16:58,200
but I know he already has a girlfriend,

413
00:16:58,200 --> 00:16:59,680
and a rich one at that.

414
00:17:00,080 --> 00:17:01,000
Since you also want

415
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:02,920
him to be happy with that girlfriend,

416
00:17:02,920 --> 00:17:04,480
then why can't you just accept me

417
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:05,680
and be with me?

418
00:17:05,680 --> 00:17:07,400
Xiao Ze, wake up, will you?

419
00:17:07,640 --> 00:17:09,720
What happens between me
and Song Yanfei is one thing.

420
00:17:09,720 --> 00:17:10,520
Whether I can accept you

421
00:17:10,520 --> 00:17:11,599
is another.

422
00:17:11,880 --> 00:17:14,140
Is there any connection between the two?

423
00:17:15,800 --> 00:17:17,060
If you don't accept me,

424
00:17:19,160 --> 00:17:21,220
then neither of us will live in peace.

